 **Data Structures:**
-*   **Volume Data:** A 3D array or 3D texture storing voxel values [S2, unofficial].
-*   **Texture Coordinates:** 3D coordinates $(u, v, w)$ in the range $[0, 1]$ representing the position within the volume [S3, unofficial].
